	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• ディズニー映画のプリンセスの美しいお城があなたのお部屋に。",
			"• 『リトル・マーメイド』のお城は高さ約17cm。塔は貝やサンゴをイメージしてデザイン。",
			"• アトランティカの人々が集まる大広間、サンゴや海藻がカラフルでかわいい中庭を再現。",
			"• パーツは手で取り外し可能。特別な道具を使わなくても手軽に作れる。",
			"• パーツの枠にも貝殻や真珠がデザインされ、かわいさを盛り込んだ仕様。",
			"• アリエルのマスコット付き。"
		],
		"en": [
			"• Bring the beautiful castles of Disney movie princesses into your room.",
			"• The castle in “The Little Mermaid” is approximately 17cm tall. The tower is designed with the image of shells and corals.",
			"• A large hall where Atlantic people gather, and a cute courtyard with colorful coral and seaweed.",
			"• Parts can be removed by hand. It can be easily made without using any special tools.",
			"• The frames of the parts are also designed with shells and pearls, giving it a cute look.",
			"• Includes Ariel mascot."
		]
	},
